Package: ptfin
Type: Package
Title: Statistics Finland Input-Output Tables and Input-Output Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Janne", "Huovari", email = "janne.huovari@gov.fi", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fetches the input-output tables (symmetric input-output table,
    use tables at basic and purchasers' prices, import use table) from the
    Statistics Finland StatFin database through the PxWeb API, and provides
    tools for input-output analysis: technical coefficients, the Leontief
    inverse, output, value added, employment and import multipliers,
    Rasmussen linkages, demand-driven impact analysis (Type I and II),
    the Leontief cost-push price model and industry cost structures.
